# Resend — newsletter capture
# When the studio's domain is purchased and verified in Resend, fill
# these in and rename this file to `.env.local`. While they're empty,
# /api/subscribe runs in test mode (logs to server console, no real
# subscription is recorded).
#
# 1. Create the API key at https://resend.com/api-keys
# 2. Create the audience at https://resend.com/audiences and copy its ID
RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_AUDIENCE_ID=
